00:44:57.397 --> 00:45:00.600
For this, the simplification
was very simple.

00:45:00.600 --> 00:45:04.170
The simplification was
literally just showing the paths

00:45:04.170 --> 00:45:06.510
in the model that were
relevant for that decision.

00:45:06.510 --> 00:45:09.330
And so we showed, if we
know for everything here,

00:45:09.330 --> 00:45:11.250
there was a right answer essentially,

00:45:11.250 --> 00:45:12.270
which is another topic

00:45:12.270 --> 00:45:14.700
