00:45:20.310 --> 00:45:22.020
What are the paths from
that to the effect?

00:45:22.020 --> 00:45:24.300
And that's what we showed people.

00:45:24.300 --> 00:45:26.730
But I think an interesting idea is about

00:45:26.730 --> 00:45:27.957
